OL,3,GNEWSAThree business groups to bid for
OL,4,Abuilding reservoir
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree multinational business groups
OL,7,Fhave been selected to tender for the
OL,8,Fbuilding of a proposed new
OL,9,F150-billion-litre reservoir in the
OL,10,FThames Valley.
OL,12,FThames Water said the groups would bid
OL,13,Fto design, build, test and commission
OL,14,Fthe White Horse Reservoir, near
OL,15,FAbingdon in Oxfordshire.
OL,17,FIt is expected the facility, with an
OL,18,Festimated cost of up to #7.5bn, would
OL,19,Ftake about a decade to build and two
OL,20,Fwinters to fill, with water available
OL,21,Ffor use from 2040.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
